  "description": {
   "en": "I'm being showered with too much love from charming spirits!!\nI'm the only one in the world whose job is \"Spirit User\"!?\n\nEllen, a baggage carrier for an S-rank party, was left behind as a decoy to help them escape the dungeon because he was useless.\nIn a desperate situation with no escape, he awakens his hidden power as a \"spirit user\"! He makes a contract with the legendary spirit \"Phoenix\" and becomes the strongest."
  },
